<main>

  <!-- PROJECTS -->
  <section class="section" id="projeler">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head rv">
        <span class="eyebrow">Selected Work</span>
        <h2 class="section-title serif">Projects</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">Hardware, software and field-tested — work carried from idea to product.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="projects">

        <article class="project feat rv">
          <div class="p-media"><img src="/assets/proj-seraos.jpg" alt="SeraOS — the rabbit soldering a circuit board"></div>
          <div class="p-top">
            <span class="pill gold">In Active Development</span>
            <span class="p-date">AUTONOMOUS POT</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="p-title serif">SeraOS — Autonomous Plant System</h3>
          <p class="p-desc">An embedded system that cares for a single potted plant fully autonomously, with no human in the loop. Water, light, temperature and humidity are read by sensors and handled by actuators — it runs completely offline.</p>
          <div class="p-feats">
            <div class="feat"><h4>Autonomous Watering</h4><p>The pump runs when the soil-moisture sensor detects dryness; a dry-run lock engages when the water runs out.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>Smart Lighting</h4><p>The grow LED is driven by a light sensor + RTC calendar, based on the daily light integral (DLI).</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>Climate Control</h4><p>The fan engages when a temperature/humidity threshold is crossed, balancing VPD.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>Uninterrupted Brain</h4><p>A LiPo UPS keeps the ESP32 alive through power cuts and resumes where it left off.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-foot">
            <div class="tags"><span class="tag">ESP32</span><span class="tag">BME280</span><span class="tag">DS18B20</span><span class="tag">LiPo UPS</span><span class="tag">microSD</span><span class="tag">OLED</span><span class="tag">PWM</span></div>
            <div class="metric"><b>3/6</b><span>Modules</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="project rv">
          <div class="p-media"><img src="/assets/proj-agrivision.jpg" alt="AgriVision — the rabbit at the strawberry conveyor"></div>
          <div class="p-top">
            <span class="pill gold">In Progress</span>
            <span class="p-date">JAN 2026</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="p-title serif">AgriVision — Strawberry Quality Control</h3>
          <p class="p-desc">An autonomous conveyor line with computer-vision support and a robotic sorting mechanism, built to eliminate human error in post-harvest processing.</p>
          <div class="p-feats">
            <div class="feat"><h4>SolidWorks Design</h4><p>The mechanical chassis and flexible TPU conveyor belt were 3D-printed.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>ESP32 Control</h4><p>Belt-speed control via a custom transistor-based motor driver board.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>Computer Vision</h4><p>Product quality analysis and sorting from IR sensor data.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>Robotic Arm</h4><p>Separating defective products with a servo-driven mechanism.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-foot">
            <div class="tags"><span class="tag">ESP32</span><span class="tag">SolidWorks</span><span class="tag">3D Printing</span><span class="tag">IR Sensor</span><span class="tag">Servo</span><span class="tag">Python</span></div>
            <div class="metric"><b>92%</b><span>Success</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="project rv">
          <div class="p-media"><img src="/assets/proj-teknofest.jpg" alt="TEKNOFEST — the rabbit installing a LoRa sensor in the field"></div>
          <div class="p-top">
            <span class="pill out">TEKNOFEST Finalist</span>
            <span class="p-date">Wireless Sensor Network</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="p-title serif">Field Terminal — Data Collection System</h3>
          <p class="p-desc">A WSN that maps soil-yield across 100+ dönüm of land. Energy-independent IoT infrastructure running on Arduino and LoRa.</p>
          <div class="p-feats">
            <div class="feat"><h4>Parcel Management</h4><p>Large fields are divided into virtual parcels for management.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>Sensor Network</h4><p>Data collection with humidity, temperature, pH and gas sensors.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>LoRa Comms</h4><p>Wireless long-range transfer with 433 MHz modules.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>Solar Power</h4><p>Solar-panel integration for energy independence.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-foot">
            <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Arduino</span><span class="tag">LoRa</span><span class="tag">WSN</span><span class="tag">IoT</span><span class="tag">Solar Panel</span></div>
            <div class="metric"><b>80/78</b><span>Jury Score</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="project rv">
          <div class="p-media"><img src="/assets/proj-baggl.jpg" alt="BAGGL — the rabbit scraping data on a computer"></div>
          <div class="p-top">
            <span class="pill out">Desktop Automation</span>
            <span class="p-date">Python · Selenium</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="p-title serif">BAGGL — Car Market Bot</h3>
          <p class="p-desc">A desktop automation tool that analyzes used-car data with hierarchical filtering.</p>
          <div class="p-feats">
            <div class="feat"><h4>Web Scraping</h4><p>Scraping data from dynamic DOM structures with Selenium.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>Hierarchical Filtering</h4><p>Detailed filtering as Brand → Model → Trim.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>SQLite Database</h4><p>Structured storage and querying of the collected data.</p></div>
            <div class="feat"><h4>User Interface</h4><p>Data visualization and analysis via a Tkinter GUI.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-foot">
            <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Selenium</span><span class="tag">SQLite</span><span class="tag">Tkinter</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SKILLS -->
