        <p class="section-intro">Skills earned along a continuous learning journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="certs">
        <div class="cert rv"><time>JAN 2026</time><div><div class="ct">MATLAB Onramp</div><div class="ci">MathWorks</div></div></div>
        <div class="cert rv"><time>2024</time><div><div class="ct">Applied Artificial Intelligence Training</div><div class="ci">TalentCoders.co</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="section" id="hakkimda">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head rv">
        <span class="eyebrow">Biosystems / Mechatronics</span>
        <h2 class="section-title serif">About</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="quote rv">I solve nature's complexity with the discipline of engineering.</p>
      <div class="about-body rv">
        <p>I'm Burak Taş, a biosystems engineer putting technology in the service of the soil. I believe the future of agriculture lies where calloused hands meet handwritten code.</p>
        <p>That's why I never confined myself to a single discipline: I understand plant physiology as much as computer-vision algorithms, and irrigation systems as much as embedded systems.</p>
        <p>With AgriVision I'm building autonomous harvesting technologies, and with my IoT work, data-driven agriculture — today. I'm chasing solutions that bring agricultural technology (AgriTech) up to world standards.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

